      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "Subsequent tensile tests at 650 ◦C revealed intricate dislocation patterns in the α-Ti matrix and their strong interaction with interfaces of α-Ti/Ti5Si3, which is indicative of an efﬁcient load transfer between the precipitates and the matrix.",
